WEBVTT

00:02.100 --> 00:04.400
shinjitai
I want to believe

00:04.530 --> 00:07.560
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light that I found that day

00:08.070 --> 00:10.810
kimi to kawashita
Because I still have

00:10.810 --> 00:15.440
tatta hitotsuno yakusoku ga arukara
That one promise that I made to you

00:15.880 --> 00:22.840
mou tachidomarazuni aruite yukitai
I want to keep walking, never stopping

00:24.590 --> 00:27.460
Dragon Drive

00:27.460 --> 00:32.950
uresugita kajitsu wo kajiru youni
Like biting into an overripe fruit

00:33.090 --> 00:36.060
yowai jibun ni
I was spoiling myself

00:36.060 --> 00:39.300
amaetsuzukete ita
I was giving in to my weakness

00:39.800 --> 00:44.170
kimi ni deawanakereba
If I hadn't met you

00:44.170 --> 00:46.140
ima mo
I'd still...

00:46.140 --> 00:52.440
kabe wo kowasu koto nado dekinakatta yo
...be unable to break the walls around me

00:54.180 --> 00:56.550
wasurenai
I'll never forget

00:56.550 --> 00:59.750
ano hi kanjita itami
The pain that I felt that day

01:00.090 --> 01:05.090
nido to ano basho modoritakunai
I never want to go back to that place

01:05.090 --> 01:06.650
motto tsuyoku
This strong feeling

01:06.800 --> 01:09.200
shinjitai
I want to believe

01:09.200 --> 01:12.330
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light I found that day

01:12.730 --> 01:17.810
kakkowarui to warawaretemo ii
Let them laugh and call me a loser

01:17.810 --> 01:20.540
bukiyou dakara
Because I'm clumsy

01:20.540 --> 01:28.640
onaji ikikata shika erabenainda
I can only choose to live life this way

01:40.730 --> 01:42.890
So that's Shinryu.

01:52.010 --> 01:55.240
Now I have the last item.

01:55.510 --> 01:58.040
I'll bury you in the darkness with the others!

02:02.680 --> 02:04.650
That dragon is a dragon of darkness!

02:04.790 --> 02:07.980
Chibi and his sacred powers can defeat it.

02:13.360 --> 02:16.420
Then my brother died because of... Kouhei.

02:16.700 --> 02:19.130
You forgot the "Mister", Mahiru.

02:19.370 --> 02:20.530
Kouhei!

02:24.670 --> 02:27.770
Father. We'll be home shortly.

02:29.640 --> 02:32.910
D-Z one

02:33.250 --> 02:34.410
Kouhei!

02:37.020 --> 02:38.710
- Stop it!
- Outta my way!

02:38.920 --> 02:40.790
I'll get rid of this guy here and now!

02:41.290 --> 02:44.120
You sure it's a good idea
to say things like that?

02:44.460 --> 02:46.720
I'll resurrect Shinryu right here!

02:46.900 --> 02:48.730
- You scum!
- You can't, Rockaku!

02:48.800 --> 02:50.020
Don't stop me, Reiji!

02:50.270 --> 02:52.960
If I don't defeat Kouhei now, I...

02:53.170 --> 02:55.660
I won't be able to face Yakou or Mahiru!

02:55.740 --> 02:58.570
But if Shinryu is resurrected,
this world will be destroyed!

02:58.840 --> 03:00.330
- What do I care!
- Rockaku!

03:01.510 --> 03:02.480
Pathetic.

03:02.540 --> 03:04.480
You're always losing your temper.

03:04.550 --> 03:05.640
Take this!

03:09.420 --> 03:10.440
Rockaku!

03:10.790 --> 03:12.410
You don't get it, do you?

03:12.750 --> 03:15.750
That's why I hate morons.

03:15.820 --> 03:17.880
Aren't you the one who doesn't get it?

03:21.530 --> 03:24.990
We're not going to let you
have your own way forever.

03:25.330 --> 03:26.630
Kouhei.

03:26.700 --> 03:28.670
Don't do anything stupid!

03:28.940 --> 03:31.270
That's right. Get the message?

03:32.370 --> 03:33.340
Shut up.

03:33.440 --> 03:36.240
I get enough lectures
from my dad.

03:39.150 --> 03:41.510
Are you sure what you said is true?

03:41.950 --> 03:43.650
Yeah. It's the truth.

03:43.990 --> 03:44.850
Then why?!

03:44.920 --> 03:47.680
Why didn't Rockaku tell me
about Kouhei?

03:48.420 --> 03:52.420
If he had told you, would you have
accepted it as the truth?

03:55.360 --> 03:57.390
I think he blamed himself
for what happened.

03:58.100 --> 04:01.970
All this time he's regretted
not being able to save your brother.

04:02.440 --> 04:05.240
Rockaku just isn't good at expressing himself.

04:08.210 --> 04:11.040
What are you saying I should do?

04:12.080 --> 04:14.380
Rockaku watched as my brother died.

04:15.020 --> 04:16.610
That's why, until now, I...

04:16.880 --> 04:18.750
That can't be helped, can it?

04:18.990 --> 04:21.720
You never knew anything
about Kouhei Toki.

04:21.960 --> 04:23.890
Not knowing is no excuse!

04:25.530 --> 04:26.520
I...

04:36.640 --> 04:37.900
Kouhei!

04:41.080 --> 04:41.940
Curse you!

04:43.080 --> 04:44.340
Let's go home, brother.

04:44.680 --> 04:45.770
Good idea!

04:45.850 --> 04:48.440
I'm bored of Rikyu and these guys!

04:49.120 --> 04:50.740
I won't let you go!

04:50.820 --> 04:52.050
You're in the way!

04:53.220 --> 04:55.590
So long! Bye-bye!

04:56.160 --> 04:57.450
You're not getting away!

04:58.330 --> 04:59.290
Rockaku!

04:59.560 --> 05:01.530
Is he planning to leave me behind again?!

05:02.460 --> 05:03.620
H-Hey, wait!

05:13.140 --> 05:14.270
We've been beaten.

05:20.520 --> 05:23.710
How can it all end like this?

05:24.250 --> 05:25.010
Reiji!

05:35.600 --> 05:37.000
There's abnormality in the transfer device!

05:37.070 --> 05:40.130
It appears that someone else has entered
other than Master Kouhei and Hideaki.

05:40.540 --> 05:41.930
Switch off the system.

05:42.240 --> 05:43.790
We're fine as long as Kouhei returns.

05:43.870 --> 05:44.840
Yes, sir.

06:03.520 --> 06:05.120
It's good to be back!

06:06.730 --> 06:09.250
I'm home, Dad!

06:11.330 --> 06:13.820
Take a look at this! Is it great, or what?!

06:17.810 --> 06:21.170
Hey, couldn't you say "good job",
or something?

06:21.240 --> 06:22.330
That's cold.

06:22.410 --> 06:23.400
- You fool!
- Oops!

06:23.480 --> 06:26.970
You could have returned sooner,
if you hadn't been fighting unnecessarily!

06:27.820 --> 06:30.310
Huh? You know about that?

06:30.850 --> 06:31.820
I see.

06:31.990 --> 06:34.580
Hideaki told you, didn't he? That brat!

06:34.760 --> 06:35.720
Hideaki!

06:35.790 --> 06:39.230
Where are you hiding?! Come out here!

06:42.630 --> 06:44.890
Transfer this to D-Z one, on the double.

06:44.970 --> 06:46.870
B-But sir...

06:47.300 --> 06:48.500
Hurry!

06:48.570 --> 06:49.700
Y-Yes, sir.

06:50.870 --> 06:51.840
Hmm?

06:55.410 --> 06:57.540
Hideaki. Are you ready?

06:58.280 --> 07:00.140
Yes, Father.

07:00.780 --> 07:03.050
What's Hideaki doing in D-Zone?

07:03.620 --> 07:04.780
Let's get started.

07:04.850 --> 07:05.820
Okay.

07:21.840 --> 07:23.960
S. Thank you.

07:44.890 --> 07:45.860
Shinryu.

07:46.360 --> 07:48.260
At last it has become mine.

07:49.700 --> 07:51.490
It's been so long.

07:51.570 --> 07:53.800
I never dreamed it would take so long.

08:00.910 --> 08:06.900
One day, I was led to Rikyu,
a different world where dragons lived.

08:13.390 --> 08:14.910
And then I found out.

08:15.620 --> 08:18.990
About a power that transcends
everything in this world.

08:19.390 --> 08:20.590
Shinryu.

08:26.600 --> 08:29.200
I searched everywhere for Shinryu.

08:45.250 --> 08:46.220
However...

08:47.190 --> 08:49.780
...in the end, I never found it.

08:55.160 --> 08:56.130
That's right.

08:56.200 --> 08:59.360
Without fulfilling my ambitions,
I was thrown back to Earth.

09:08.280 --> 09:09.770
I was shocked.

09:10.710 --> 09:14.740
Earth was being destroyed
because of foolish humans.

09:17.990 --> 09:20.010
It was then that I realized...

09:20.120 --> 09:23.780
...the reason why
I had been summoned to Rikyu.

09:24.530 --> 09:26.460
I had been chosen by Shinryu.

09:27.230 --> 09:31.160
I needed the powers of Shinryu...

09:31.230 --> 09:34.530
...to save this world from its path
of certain destruction.

09:35.770 --> 09:41.040
Then, I learned of people who
had been led to Rikyu, just like myself.

09:42.140 --> 09:45.010
Together, we searched for a way
to return to Rikyu.

09:45.380 --> 09:49.080
I had to respond to the words of Shinryu,
no matter what.

09:50.220 --> 09:51.710
With Shinryu's powers...

09:51.790 --> 09:54.350
...I will build a new world.

09:55.620 --> 09:56.920
These numbers are unbelievable!

09:57.630 --> 09:59.790
If we release this in D-Z one...

10:00.730 --> 10:02.360
Is he serious?

10:02.430 --> 10:05.490
Does he plan to destroy Earth
with these powers?

10:07.170 --> 10:08.140
What is it?

10:10.000 --> 10:11.730
All right. I'll be right there.

10:13.540 --> 10:16.070
I just got word that the voltage is decreasing.

10:16.810 --> 10:19.580
I doubt it's anything serious,
but I'll go and check just in case.

10:19.910 --> 10:20.880
All right.

10:25.290 --> 10:28.260
Is Hideaki going to resurrect Shinryu?

10:28.920 --> 10:30.190
You're still here?

10:30.520 --> 10:32.150
Your job is finished.

10:32.230 --> 10:33.350
Get out of here.

10:34.430 --> 10:36.260
What is it with adults?

10:36.630 --> 10:39.070
They make all the decisions
without talking to kids.

10:39.130 --> 10:40.830
I went through all the trouble of getting it.

10:40.900 --> 10:43.100
I'd like to be in charge of it right to the end.

10:43.300 --> 10:45.270
I'm telling you to back off!

10:45.970 --> 10:48.340
And what will you do if I don't?

10:50.780 --> 10:54.510
It's too bad that adults
can't dive into D-Z one!

11:01.460 --> 11:04.050
I'm the one who'll win in the end!

11:07.800 --> 11:10.790
Hideaki. Give me the Dragonite.

11:11.730 --> 11:12.700
Kouhei.

11:13.100 --> 11:15.800
Huh? You're not showing me respect!

11:16.570 --> 11:18.270
Bad boys like that get...

11:18.340 --> 11:19.310
This!

11:20.440 --> 11:23.770
Stop it, brother. You'll make Father unhappy.

11:24.680 --> 11:26.540
I'll make Dad unhappy?

11:26.710 --> 11:27.540
Shut up!

12:05.350 --> 12:07.650
How long is he going to stay like that?

12:07.990 --> 12:10.680
Do you think he's already
given up or something?

12:10.760 --> 12:12.660
No. He hasn't given up.

12:12.860 --> 12:17.260
Reiji Ohzora would never give up,
no matter what.

12:19.630 --> 12:21.600
I just get the feeling that it's hopeless.

12:21.670 --> 12:23.030
You think so?

12:23.240 --> 12:25.400
Well, what will you do
if we can get back to Earth?

12:26.040 --> 12:27.670
Let's see.

12:27.940 --> 12:31.210
I'd be willing to start dating you, Kyoji.

12:31.550 --> 12:33.510
If we really can get back, that is.

12:34.150 --> 12:36.710
Really? That's not a bad offer.

12:38.090 --> 12:39.710
Where are you going, Kyoji?

12:39.990 --> 12:41.980
I'm gonna look for a way back.

12:43.420 --> 12:44.720
Wait for me!

12:44.790 --> 12:46.850
I'll go with you!

12:49.030 --> 12:50.620
What's wrong, Daisuke?

12:50.900 --> 12:53.060
I think you should be resting right now.

12:53.300 --> 12:56.330
You need to allow your injuries
from the last battle to heal.

12:56.540 --> 12:57.730
He's right.

12:58.210 --> 12:59.570
What are you saying?!

12:59.640 --> 13:01.700
Reiji's desperately trying
to think of what to do!

13:01.780 --> 13:03.110
We should, too!

13:04.150 --> 13:06.050
We can't give up!

13:06.750 --> 13:07.650
Daisuke!

13:14.120 --> 13:16.180
We haven't lost to RI-ON yet!

13:16.490 --> 13:18.080
I'll try and think of something, too!

13:20.330 --> 13:21.290
Daisuke.

13:22.060 --> 13:23.460
Shall we join them?

13:23.530 --> 13:24.400
Huh?

13:24.470 --> 13:25.520
That might be a good idea.

13:25.600 --> 13:27.900
Sitting around doing nothing
will only make us depressed.

13:28.200 --> 13:31.900
And we can't keep relying on Reiji
and letting him get all the glory.

13:32.340 --> 13:33.100
Yeah!

13:33.170 --> 13:34.640
Reiji!

13:34.710 --> 13:36.840
Hikaru. Care to join us?

13:38.910 --> 13:40.380
Always so difficult.

13:42.920 --> 13:43.940
I'll help, too!

13:44.250 --> 13:46.240
We're going to join you.

13:46.820 --> 13:47.950
Guys!

13:50.320 --> 13:53.380
Really? We can't use the transfer device?

13:53.630 --> 13:57.590
No. Saizou Toki has put an electronic lock
on all systems related to D-Z one.

13:57.970 --> 13:59.300
Not even I can access it.

13:59.430 --> 14:00.960
Can't you break the lock?

14:01.400 --> 14:04.840
With enough time,
I'm sure I can do something.

14:04.910 --> 14:06.300
Then start working on it!

14:06.440 --> 14:08.310
You have to break that lock somehow!

14:09.310 --> 14:10.900
What do you have in mind?

14:14.750 --> 14:16.510
Never mind. So...

14:16.580 --> 14:17.710
...what are you going to do?

14:17.790 --> 14:20.150
I'll do whatever I can!

14:20.650 --> 14:22.650
All right. Don't let them find you.

14:22.790 --> 14:23.760
You, too.

14:28.600 --> 14:31.000
How did I get myself
into this mess anyway?

14:31.800 --> 14:34.530
All I ever wanted to do was create games.

14:36.570 --> 14:37.830
Hold on, Meguru.

14:38.340 --> 14:39.830
I'll save you no matter what.

14:43.940 --> 14:47.110
There must be a way to stop RI-ON.

14:47.550 --> 14:48.880
I'm sure there is.

14:49.150 --> 14:49.840
Take this!

14:51.750 --> 14:54.690
What's wrong, Hideaki?
Show me what you've got!

14:55.620 --> 14:56.680
Brother...

14:57.760 --> 14:59.730
I guess that's all you can do.

15:00.090 --> 15:02.690
C'mon. Give me the Dragonite already.

15:02.960 --> 15:03.930
No way.

15:04.600 --> 15:05.530
Oh, really?

15:05.600 --> 15:07.530
In that case, take this!

15:10.700 --> 15:11.670
It's mine!

15:12.040 --> 15:13.970
It looks like Hideaki was not up to the task.

15:26.550 --> 15:30.080
I shall resurrect Shinryu myself!

15:32.060 --> 15:34.760
The Dragonite has come back to me!

15:34.830 --> 15:35.760
Give it back.

15:36.860 --> 15:37.830
Hideaki?

15:38.370 --> 15:40.700
But I just got rid of you!

15:41.340 --> 15:42.930
Give it back, brother!

15:43.640 --> 15:44.500
Shut up!

15:44.570 --> 15:47.170
I haven't got the time
to play around with you.

15:51.010 --> 15:52.640
Father will be angry with you.

15:53.110 --> 15:54.840
Give back the Dragonite!

15:55.050 --> 15:57.070
You're a real pain, you little brat!

16:03.590 --> 16:06.120
Where in the world am I?

16:07.900 --> 16:08.690
Mahiru!

16:10.460 --> 16:11.430
Mahiru!

16:12.430 --> 16:14.090
Where do you think you're going?

16:14.170 --> 16:15.600
I'm right here!

16:15.840 --> 16:19.030
There's one other guy that
I need to defeat before I face you.

16:19.210 --> 16:20.170
Kouhei?

16:22.540 --> 16:24.030
Such a big shot!

16:24.280 --> 16:25.840
I'll defeat Kouhei!

16:25.910 --> 16:27.040
Stay out of my way!

16:27.450 --> 16:29.210
I can't accept that!

16:32.820 --> 16:33.790
Blast it!

16:36.520 --> 16:39.190
G-Give it back, brother.

16:40.690 --> 16:42.160
Give it back...

16:42.960 --> 16:44.620
He's...

16:44.700 --> 16:47.360
I get it. So that's why.

16:47.430 --> 16:48.400
Kouhei!

16:51.040 --> 16:52.630
Hand over the Dragonite!

16:53.140 --> 16:55.130
D-Dad?!

16:56.910 --> 16:58.100
Father!

16:58.650 --> 17:00.310
You've come for me, Father!

17:00.610 --> 17:01.950
I'm so glad.

17:02.720 --> 17:05.690
I finally get to meet you, Father.

17:05.750 --> 17:07.220
- Disappear.
- Huh?

17:07.690 --> 17:09.490
You're in my way. Disappear.

17:09.720 --> 17:11.880
Th-That's cruel, Father.

17:11.990 --> 17:13.550
And when we've finally met...

17:13.630 --> 17:17.360
I wanted so badly to see you.
I did everything you told me to.

17:19.000 --> 17:21.130
You still don't get it do you, Hideaki?

17:21.600 --> 17:24.330
He doesn't really have any children.

17:25.170 --> 17:27.140
What are you saying, brother?

17:27.470 --> 17:29.100
It's a lie, right?

17:29.410 --> 17:31.310
My brother is lying, right?

17:33.980 --> 17:37.180
Why won't you answer, Father?

17:37.580 --> 17:40.950
I'm telling ya, that guy's
not your father or anything else!

17:41.190 --> 17:42.450
Shut up!

17:42.520 --> 17:45.650
I'm not like you,
always causing Father trouble!

17:46.060 --> 17:48.760
That's right,
I'm nothing but a tool.

17:49.060 --> 17:51.690
A tool used to bring
the Dragonite back from Rikyu.

17:52.470 --> 17:53.760
Right, Dad?!

17:54.800 --> 17:58.970
You're a computer program
created to keep an eye on me.

17:59.110 --> 18:00.660
You're not even human!

18:01.640 --> 18:02.730
That's a lie.

18:02.810 --> 18:04.210
I'm human.

18:04.980 --> 18:06.500
I'm Father's son.

18:06.780 --> 18:08.480
I am, right, Father?

18:13.420 --> 18:14.390
Fath...

18:15.920 --> 18:16.890
Father...

18:16.990 --> 18:18.390
I have no further use for you.

18:18.760 --> 18:19.730
I'm deleting you.

18:22.860 --> 18:24.890
No! I don't want to disappear!

18:25.800 --> 18:26.890
Father!

18:32.440 --> 18:34.910
I guess I shouldn't talk...

18:35.410 --> 18:37.810
...but you're really cruel, Dad.

18:38.550 --> 18:40.740
You will give me the Dragonite.

18:41.180 --> 18:42.150
No way.

18:42.680 --> 18:45.850
Kouhei. Playtime is over.

18:46.220 --> 18:48.920
Only according to your scenario.

18:48.990 --> 18:54.590
But now that I've found the bonus level,
I can't let it end here.

18:54.900 --> 18:55.920
It's no use.

18:56.000 --> 18:58.490
You can't control Shinryu's powers.

18:58.830 --> 18:59.920
Don't be so sure.

19:00.430 --> 19:02.330
Can't know until I give it a try.

19:02.400 --> 19:03.600
You fool!

19:16.020 --> 19:17.240
Let's go, Chibi!

19:17.320 --> 19:18.280
Reiji!

19:18.490 --> 19:20.390
Hey! Where are you going?!

19:24.660 --> 19:25.960
- Meguru.
- Right.

19:32.900 --> 19:33.800
Elder!

19:34.300 --> 19:37.130
We may be able to return to Earth!

19:37.670 --> 19:39.660
Reiji, you've sensed it as well.

19:39.740 --> 19:40.710
Yes!

19:40.810 --> 19:42.930
It will be a fierce battle.

19:43.210 --> 19:45.510
I know. But I've gotta do it.

19:46.250 --> 19:47.210
Reiji.

19:47.280 --> 19:48.250
Hey!

19:49.450 --> 19:52.440
Have you found a way
to return to Earth?

19:52.820 --> 19:53.790
Y-Yeah.

19:53.850 --> 19:55.880
Really? Way to go, Reiji!

19:56.190 --> 19:57.590
Then let's go right now.

19:57.790 --> 20:00.450
We'll get the Dragonite back
for sure this time!

20:00.760 --> 20:02.420
It can't be done right away!

20:02.700 --> 20:03.660
Huh?

20:03.730 --> 20:05.160
What do you mean?

20:08.400 --> 20:11.600
I have a bad feeling about this...

20:12.910 --> 20:14.460
I'm impressed, Dad.

20:14.610 --> 20:17.240
Where were you hiding such
a strong dragon?

20:17.540 --> 20:18.510
Kouhei.

20:19.250 --> 20:21.180
There's no use trying to oppose me.

20:21.920 --> 20:25.510
I've controlled your every move until now.

20:25.890 --> 20:27.440
You would say that.

20:27.960 --> 20:31.290
But I've leveled up, too, you know!

20:32.090 --> 20:34.530
This is the strongest power-up I've ever had!

20:41.970 --> 20:45.060
What's that? It can't be...

20:45.610 --> 20:46.970
Let's go, Mahiru!

20:47.240 --> 20:47.970
Right!

20:54.620 --> 20:56.210
Jigen Joker.

20:58.090 --> 20:59.750
Everyone, listen up.

21:00.490 --> 21:02.420
We can get back to Earth.

21:03.190 --> 21:07.590
What's waiting for us is a battle
like none we've ever faced before.

21:08.600 --> 21:10.690
But we have to do this.

21:11.100 --> 21:16.330
We have to make sure that,
this time, it really is the last battle!

21:19.110 --> 21:20.200
Elder.

21:20.670 --> 21:21.440
Yes.

21:32.290 --> 21:33.980
Shinryu...

21:34.320 --> 21:36.760
Now the game really starts.

21:37.090 --> 21:40.060
The final stage begins at last!

21:56.710 --> 21:59.370
taikutsu datta
I was bored

21:59.450 --> 22:02.140
okubyou datta
I was a coward

22:02.220 --> 22:06.150
dareka wo jibun wo kizutsukete ita
I was hurting someone and myself

22:07.620 --> 22:10.320
tsuyogari itte
I tried to hide my weakness

22:10.390 --> 22:12.550
wagamama itte
I was being selfish

22:13.030 --> 22:17.120
doushiyoumonai kimochi mamoritsuzukete
Protecting the uncontrollable feeling

22:18.570 --> 22:21.160
otona ni natte
I became an adult

22:21.230 --> 22:23.900
kimi to deatte
Then I met you

22:23.970 --> 22:27.930
mune no sumikko yawarakaku natte
My heart got softened

22:29.280 --> 22:31.710
setsunaku natta
Longing for love

22:31.780 --> 22:34.710
dakishime atta
We embraced each other

22:34.780 --> 22:39.650
hakkiri mamorubeki mono wo mitsuketa
I finally knew what I wanted to protect

22:40.320 --> 22:42.980
tatta hitotsu no yuuki ga
Only one courage

22:43.060 --> 22:45.750
tatta hitotsu no kotoba ga
Just one word

22:45.830 --> 22:50.460
futari owaranai yume e to hakobu
Take us to an endless dream

22:51.200 --> 22:53.890
hon no chiisana yasashisa ga
Only a small kindness

22:53.970 --> 22:56.560
hon no wazuka na sasayaki ga
Only a small whisper

22:56.640 --> 23:01.270
futari wo sotto tsutsunde kureru
Wrap us gently

23:01.940 --> 23:06.440
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:07.380 --> 23:13.050
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:15.460 --> 23:17.920
Next time

23:17.990 --> 23:19.290
You're kidding, right?!

23:19.360 --> 23:21.990
Shinryu is really going to awaken?!

23:22.060 --> 23:23.390
Resurrected!

23:23.460 --> 23:27.020
But what I wanna know is,
what's with that Saizou Toki guy?!

23:27.100 --> 23:28.030
An old man.

23:28.100 --> 23:32.300
He's fighting a heated battle against Kouhei,
and boy, is he strong or what?

23:32.770 --> 23:35.540
What?! Kouhei is about to lose?!

23:35.610 --> 23:36.940
Really?!

23:37.010 --> 23:38.980
Next, on Dragon Drive, "The Return".

23:39.450 --> 23:42.350
By the way, when will we
be able to return to Earth?!

23:42.350 --> 23:43.420
The Return
